      "side": 1,
      "message": "step 1 is to update the \"EC Pinmux for Brya-Internal Only\" spreadsheet.\nstep 2 is to rerun the generator script that produces this file from\nthe spreadsheet.\n\nwe\u0027ll need to have a separate discussion about which repo should\nhold the generator script.",
