      "writtenOn": "2021-01-29T23:54:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "i\u0027ll check with the doc owner about sharing it with partners. i think\nit\u0027s reasonable for people with schematics access to be included.\n\nthe generator utility will need to go into a private repo as there\nis non-public data (EC chip description) in there. YH is suggesting\nsrc/platform/ec/private.\n\nat a minimum, partners can copy brya\u0027s definitions as the baseline for\ntheir variant and manually customize as they always have. if their\nworkflow includes generating a spreadsheet of their GPIOs, we can\nwork with them to enable them to auto-generate the definitions.",
